   "text": "rate yield going down and so locking in a rate that they could hold for no decades was very appealing for them Coin Stories is powered by BitGo, the leading digital asset infrastructure company."
  },
  {
   "start": 1556.482,
   "end": 1561.262,
   "text": "BitGo now offers individuals free, insured, institutional grade custody."
  },
  {
   "start": 1561.402,
   "end": 1567.522,
   "text": "Keep full control of your Bitcoin secured by a publicly traded, federally regulated digital asset bank."
  },
  {
   "start": 1567.622,
   "end": 1570.002,
   "text": "Sign up for free at BitGo .com slash Natalie."
  },
  {
   "start": 1570.262,
   "end": 1573.442,
   "text": "With all the hacks and cybersecurity scares lately, it's a reminder."
  },
  {
   "start": 1573.682,
   "end": 1576.802,
   "text": "Protecting your Bitcoin is just as important as owning it."
  },
  {
   "start": 1576.822,
   "end": 1581.482,
   "text": "What I like about BitKees approach is that it requires two of three separate keys to move your..."
  },
  {
   "start": 1581.012,
   "end": 1581.432,
   "text": "Bitcoin."
  },
  {
   "start": 1581.772,
   "end": 1583.752,
   "text": "So one compromised key isn't enough."
  },
  {
   "start": 1583.912,
   "end": 1589.112,
   "text": "Download BitKee today and use my promo code stories to get 10 % off the second generation BitKee."
  },
  {
   "start": 1589.232,
   "end": 1590.792,
   "text": "This episode is sponsored by BitKee."
  },
  {
   "start": 1590.932,
   "end": 1597.172,
   "text": "If your Bitcoin can be frozen or monitored by an exchange, a custodial provider, or anyone else, it's not yours."
  },
  {
   "start": 1597.592,
   "end": 1602.692,
   "text": "My friends at the Bitcoin Way are the experts to hold your hand and train you to be your own bank."
  },
  {
   "start": 1602.812,
   "end": 1604.232,
   "text": "It's not rocket science."
  },
  {
   "start": 1604.452,
   "end": 1607.192,
   "text": "Anyone can master Bitcoin self -custody with the right training."
  },
  {
   "start": 1607.292,
   "end": 1607.952,
   "text": "So don't delay."
  },
  {
   "start": 1608.112,
   "end": 1610.132,
   "text": "Go to the Bitcoinway .com slash Natalie."
  },
  {
   "start": 1610.222,
   "end": 1613.062,
   "text": "to schedule a free introductory call with their team."
  },
  {
   "start": 1613.282,
   "end": 1616.522,
   "text": "I remember my first news job I was making like 20 something thousand."
  },
  {
   "start": 1616.822,
   "end": 1619.422,
   "text": "I didn't start putting away in my 401k when I should have."
  },
  {
   "start": 1619.502,
   "end": 1624.742,
   "text": "What's your argument for considering even having an IRA if you're a bitconer?"
  },
  {
   "start": 1625.042,
   "end": 1625.482,
   "text": "Taxes."
  },
  {
   "start": 1625.742,
   "end": 1630.702,
   "text": "You're going to solve some Bitcoin and you're going to move it into dirty dollars or whatever currency survives the dollar."
  },
  {
   "start": 1631.002,
   "end": 1633.102,
   "text": "And there'll be a taxable event for that liquidation."
  },
  {
   "start": 1633.202,
   "end": 1638.542,
   "text": "If you do it in a Roth, you could turn $5 ,000 into a half million and you're going to take it all out entirely tax free."
  },
  {
